I have investigated the issue by replicating the scenario and reviewing the application logs.

Based on the analysis, this scenario is entirely different from the issue addressed under BEADEV-13693 and is not related to the fix delivered as part of that ticket.

Additionally, I was able to reproduce the same behaviour in UAT1, which confirms that this is an existing issue and not a recent regression.

Root Cause:

The issue occurs when Collateral Ops clicks Save without selecting a Validation Status. Although the application displays a warning asking the user to select a status, the form still proceeds with the submission.

As a result, the application attempts to save the collateral document without a Validation Status, leading to an error and displaying the Ouch screen.

To summarise, this is a separate, pre-existing issue concerning the validation of the Validation Status field during submission. It is independent of BEADEV-13693.

